                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg647">p. 647</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d337-f3" n="3" xml:id="d337-f3-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg656">p. 656</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d337-f4" n="4" xml:id="d337-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram 196 from Amman, May 14, the Legation reported in part that it learned
                    that the proposal to have the two sides withdraw previous correspondence was
                    discussed without result at a meeting held May 11 between the King, Prime
                    Minister Rifai, and Mr. Shiloah. (684A.85/5–1451)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
